                %li
                  %a{:href => "#FieldCombiningVariousProperties"} Fields combining these properties
                %ul
                  %li
                    %a{:href => "#TwistedDifferentialcStructurs"}
                      %strong General
                      – Twisted differential-cocycles and -
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                              %mi c
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{c}
                      \-structures
                  %li
                    %a{:href => "#NonabelianChargedParticle"} Nonabelian charged particle trajectories – Wilson line
                  %li
                    %a{:href => "#ChernSimonsWithWilsonLines"} 3d Chern-Simons field with Wilson line
                  %li
                    %a{:href => "#ChanPatonGaugeFields"} Chan-Paton gauge fields on D-branes: twisted differential K-cocycles
                  %li
