          %p
            Smooth functions on jet bundles turn out to
            %em locally
            depend on only finitely many of the jet coordinates:
          .num_prop
            %h6#proposition Proposition
            %p
              Given a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/jet+bundle"} jet bundle
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
