          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_4 Remark
            %p
              Proposition
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ModuliStackOfFieldsAsHomotopyFiber"}
              makes precise the heuristic idea that a field
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
