          %h3#ForceFields
            %strong I)
            Force fields
          %p
            We discuss examples for the two classes of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/force"} force
            fields, which are:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#FieldsOfGravityAndGeneralizedGeometry"}> Fields of gravity, G-structure and generalized geometry
                ;
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#GaugeFields"}> Gauge fields
                \.
          %h4#FieldsOfGravityAndGeneralizedGeometry
            %strong I a)
            Fields of gravity,
            = succeed "-Structure" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi G
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
