          %p
            Since
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 2
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi sLine
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 2 \mathbf{sLine}
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Picard+3-group"} Picard 3-group
            of the monoidal 2-stack
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 2
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi sVect
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 2 \mathbf{sVect}
            of super
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-vector+bundles"} 2-vector bundles
            it is a supergeometric
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/3-group"} 3-group
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delooping"} delooping
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi B
                  %mn 2
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi sLine
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{B}2\mathbf{sLine}
            and hence the differential refinement
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mn 2
                  %msub
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi sLine
