          %p Some further slight variants of these combinations appear in the examples below.
          %h4#NonabelianChargedParticle Nonabelian charged particle trajectories – Wilson line
          %p
            We describe here a variant of the particle propagating on a spacetime
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
