            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Borel-Weil-Bott+theorem"} Borel-Weil-Bott theorem
            this corresponds equivalently to a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weight+%28in+representation+theory%29"} weight
